{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building Recipe</strong> tells the story of a restaurant owner who dreamed of opening their own place\u2014<br>only to be tricked into a shady lease by a greedy landlord.<br>Now, it\u2019s time to rise again, build the ultimate restaurant, and take revenge on that landlord!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf73 Discover, Cook, and Upgrade!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover new recipes, cook creative dishes, and strengthen your menu to become the best chef in town.<br>Your goal? Turn your small kitchen into a thriving empire and serve justice\u2014with flavor!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf71 Over 200 Unique Dishes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047920/extras/548d9d0da023dfbcb23f12834f6fd2a9.poster.avif?t=1761116482\" width=360 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047920/extras/548d9d0da023dfbcb23f12834f6fd2a9.webm?t=1761116482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hundreds of dishes waiting to be discovered!<br>Experiment with various ingredients and combinations to create all sorts of delicious meals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 The Recipe Codex</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047920/extras/aaeef0e9b8702fb43a1f765a76dddbd2.avif?t=1761116482\" width=1114 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dish you create or discover is added to your Codex.<br>Fill it out by experimenting and finding every recipe hidden in the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Power Up Your Dishes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers will get greedier and more demanding with every stage!<br>To keep up, you\u2019ll need to enhance your dishes.<br>Check each dish\u2019s unique effects and make them stronger\u2014and tastier\u2014than ever before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047920?t=1761116482","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047920/fa917a81f5072935111c79dad533eb0eb53b67ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761116482","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047920/a14ca85c090aeaa69b3d02b2c49adbb53fb7f15d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761116482","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047920/a14ca85c090aeaa69b3d02b2c49adbb53fb7f15d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761116482","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building Recipe</strong> tells the story of a restaurant owner who dreamed of opening their own place\u2014<br>only to be tricked into a shady lease by a greedy landlord.<br>Now, it\u2019s time to rise again, build the ultimate restaurant, and take revenge on that landlord!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf73 Discover, Cook, and Upgrade!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover new recipes, cook creative dishes, and strengthen your menu to become the best chef in town.<br>Your goal? Turn your small kitchen into a thriving empire and serve justice\u2014with flavor!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf71 Over 200 Unique Dishes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047920/extras/548d9d0da023dfbcb23f12834f6fd2a9.poster.avif?t=1761116482\" width=360 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic